# GitHub's "Download ZIP" of the source is built with git archive, which leaves
# these out. Definitive Mod Manager reads any loose .json as a JSON patch mod and
# rejects release.json, and the old test builds would install a plugin for a
# game build that is long gone. The release archives on Nexus and the Releases
# page are built by package.ps1 and are not affected.
release.json export-ignore
docs/test-builds/ export-ignore
